 "text": "Assessor Sales Files\nSelect Language ​ ▼\nHome\nCounty\nAbout\nEmployment\nHistory\nHistorical Information\nVisitors Committee Grant App\nOffices\nAssessor\nAssessor's\nOffice\nGIS Workshop\nSales Files\nAttorney\nBoard of Commissioners\nBoard Members\nMeeting Agenda\nMeeting Minutes\nClerk\nClerk's Office\nBirth Certificate Info\nMarriage License\nMilitary\nDischarge\nProperty Valuation\nProtests\nSpecial\nLicenses\nCounty Court\nClerk of the District Court\nDistrict\nCourt Office\nCourt Filing Fees\nSelf Help\nElection Commissioner\nElection Commissioner's\nOffice\nElection Information\nLocal Election Results\nEmergency Manager\nExtension\nOffice\nHighway Department\nPlanning and Zoning\nRegister of\nDeeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nTreasurer's\nOffice\nBoating Guide\nBoating Registration\nDriver's\nExam\nDrivers Licenses\nTitles and Registration\nUnclaimed Property\nVeterans Services Officer\nWeed Superintendent\nCalendar\nContacts\nOffice Links\nOffice Services\nOther Organizations\nFeedback\n-->\nAssessor Sales Files\nThis is all 521's, deeds, if it is a good sale assessment\ninformation will also be included.\n|\n|\n2026\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2025\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2024\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2023\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2022\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2021\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2020\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary |\n2019\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary\n|\n2018\nDecember\nNovember\nOctober\nSeptember\nAugust\nJuly\nJune\nMay\nApril\nMarch\nFebruary\nJanuary\n|\n2017\nJanuary\nFebruary\nMarch\nApril\nMay\nJune\nJuly\nAugust\nSeptember\nOctober\nNovember\nDecember\n|\nProperty Valuation Protests\nProtest Instructions - This form must be attached to your\nprotest.\nEditable Property Valuation Protest, Form 422A\nInformation about Values\nHow the Assessor's Office Set Your Valuation\nResidential Sales\nThe residential sales file uses sale dates from 10-1-2021 to\n9-30-2023 per State Statute. Assessed level of value for\nresidential property for the 2024 valuation year is 98% of market\nvaluation.\nCommercial Sales\nThe commercial sales file uses sales from 10-1-2020 to 9-30-2023\nper State Statute. Assessed level of value for commercial property\nfor the 2024 valuation year is 96% of market valuation.\nCommercial Coding\nThere are limited commercial usage codes for al the various\ncommercial buildings within Webster County. Therefore, commercial\nbuildings are grouped together by similar usage and pricing. See\nthe “Commercial Coding” Link above for usage descriptions.\nAgricultural Land Values\nAgricultural Sales File\nThe agricultural sales file uses the sale dates from 10-1-2020 to\n9-30-2023 per State Statute. Agricultural land is valued at 74% of\nmarket value. All “Site” values are at 100% of market.\nCopyright © 2012 MIPS Inc. All rights reserved. |\nDisclaimer\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate",
